    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d327">

                <pb facs="0546" n="444" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg444"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.114 Bodo/65: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at St. Pierre</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gunsaulus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">St. Pierre</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-12-18T14:00:00-04:00">December 18,
                            1935—2 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 2:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Referring to Department’s telegram of December 18th,<anchor n="83"
                        xml:id="d327-f1"/> the following telegram was sent to Halifax by the
                    undersigned: <pb facs="0547" n="445" xml:id="pg445"/>
                    <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“December 18, noon. Have been informed unofficially that master of the
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Bodo</hi> received instructions from the
                            Norwegian Government not to discharge on the high seas and that the
                            alcohol is still aboard ship, and that providing money for duty is
                            raised it will be unloaded here, also that vessel carries cargo of coal
                            for Maufroy at St. Pierre-Miquelon and that alcohol is on top of coal.
                            Will confirm as soon as possible and will report further
                            developments.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Bodo</hi> now at American House pier. I am conferring
                    with Administrator and will report developments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gunsaulus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
